  section#takeaway
    h2 Takeaway

    p The Ayn Rand Archives demonstrate a practical middle path for AI in transcription: use AI to remove friction, not judgment.

    p By keeping AI drafts optional, transparent, and clearly tentative, FromThePage helps institutions move faster—without compromising the values that matter most.

